{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38876","headline":"春日行次钱塘却寄台州姚中丞 · 杜荀鹤","name":"春日行次钱塘却寄台州姚中丞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"岂爲无心求上第，难安帝里爲家贫。\n江南江北闲爲客，潮去潮来老却人。\n两岸雨收莺语柳，一楼风满角吹春。\n花前不独垂乡泪，曾是朱门寄食身。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38876.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38876","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}